# theHarvester — Email & Subdomain Recon

The first tool every pentester runs on a target.

## What is theHarvester?
Free open-source recon tool that gathers emails,
subdomains, IPs, and employee names from Google,
Bing, LinkedIn, Shodan, and 20+ more sources.
Pre-installed on Kali Linux.

## Installation
sudo apt install theharvester -y

OR via git:
git clone https://github.com/laramies/theHarvester
cd theHarvester
pip3 install -r requirements.txt

## Commands
theHarvester -d target.com -b google      Google search
theHarvester -d target.com -b bing        Bing search
theHarvester -d target.com -b linkedin    find employees
theHarvester -d target.com -b shodan      find open ports
theHarvester -d target.com -b all         use all sources
theHarvester -d target.com -b all -l 100  limit 100 results
theHarvester -d target.com -b all -f out  save to file

